@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> AccountCreation

state "Account Creation" as AccountCreation
AccountCreation : entry / Action needed
AccountCreation : do / enter account details
AccountCreation : exit / Account created

state WatchVideos
WatchVideos : entry / from AccountCreated
WatchVideos : do / watch videos
WatchVideos : exit / NIL

state UploadVideo
UploadVideo : entry / from WatchVideos
UploadVideo : do / upload video
UploadVideo : exit / NIL

state SaveVideo
SaveVideo : entry / from WatchVideos
SaveVideo : do / save video in likes list
SaveVideo : exit / NIL

state LikesList
LikesList : entry / from AccountCreated
LikesList : do / view saved videos
LikesList : exit / NIL

WatchVideos --> SaveVideo
WatchVideos --> UploadVideo
UploadVideo --> WatchVideos
SaveVideo --> LikesList
LikesList --> WatchVideos

state DiscussionOption
DiscussionOption : entry / from WatchVideos
DiscussionOption : do / enter discussion option
DiscussionOption : exit / NIL

WatchVideos --> DiscussionOption
@enduml
